  Research artifact on finite-field representation engineering for AES-like
  arithmetic and reproducible cryptanalytic time-memory tradeoffs, with Java
  and Rust reference implementations, exact coverage measurements, historical
  reconstruction, and an evolving ePrint manuscript.
